1
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:25,379
Step by step, the rhythms slow,

2
00:00:26,149 --> 00:00:30,070
Hold my waist, don't let me go.

3
00:00:31,039 --> 00:00:35,609
Crimson silk against your skin,

4
00:00:35,978 --> 00:00:40,009
Where do I end and you begin?

5
00:00:40,950 --> 00:00:45,750
Say something now and break this stone,

6
00:00:45,868 --> 00:00:50,439
Don't leave me dancing here alone.

7
00:00:50,820 --> 00:00:55,420
I feel your heart beat on my chest,

8
00:00:55,700 --> 00:01:00,280
Why do you bury all the rest?

9
00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:05,218
Cold as ice, your trembling hand,

10
00:01:05,670 --> 00:01:09,930
Sinking down like desert sand.

11
00:01:10,640 --> 00:01:15,010
Look into my open eyes,

12
00:01:15,599 --> 00:01:20,280
Kill the silence and the lies.

13
00:01:20,540 --> 00:01:24,968
Look at me, Paul, the room is cold,

14
00:01:25,459 --> 00:01:29,769
This is the truth we cannot hold.

15
00:01:30,459 --> 00:01:34,980
You turn away behind your wall,

16
00:01:35,420 --> 00:01:39,590
Catch my hand before I fall.

17
00:01:40,590 --> 00:01:45,209
Tears are burning on my cheek,

18
00:01:45,620 --> 00:01:50,218
Floors are tilting, knees grow weak.

19
00:01:50,578 --> 00:01:54,500
I don't care who sees us now,

20
00:01:55,209 --> 00:01:59,650
Break the rules and break the vow.

21
00:02:00,489 --> 00:02:04,840
Hear me scream without a sound,

22
00:02:05,400 --> 00:02:09,870
As we turn this room around.

23
00:02:10,378 --> 00:02:14,639
Take our love before we die,

24
00:02:15,340 --> 00:02:19,169
Give me love or tell me why.

25
00:02:42,680 --> 00:02:46,508
Music fades into the floor,

26
00:02:47,508 --> 00:02:52,038
I can't take this anymore.

27
00:02:52,188 --> 00:02:56,818
All my courage turns to dust,

28
00:02:57,188 --> 00:03:01,770
Choking on this desperate trust.

29
00:03:02,060 --> 00:03:06,740
I wanted you to hear it all,

30
00:03:07,030 --> 00:03:11,770
Before I let the curtain fall.

31
00:03:11,990 --> 00:03:16,389
I open up my lips to speak,

32
00:03:16,658 --> 00:03:22,020
And find my dying voice too weak.

33
00:03:22,520 --> 00:03:26,650
I wanted you to hear it all,

34
00:03:27,500 --> 00:03:30,960
Before I let the curtain fall.

35
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:36,120
I open up my lips to speak,

36
00:03:37,259 --> 00:03:43,259
And find my dying voice too weak.